WEBVTT

00:11.430 --> 00:13.660
Spring is still far away.

00:14.700 --> 00:19.120
How long has it been since 
you started serving me?

00:19.120 --> 00:21.610
I believe this year will 
be my seventh year.

00:21.610 --> 00:23.420
Has it only been that long?

00:24.960 --> 00:27.110
To me, it seemed far longer...

00:28.090 --> 00:32.540
Although I have closely watched you 
as my brother's childhood friend.

00:32.920 --> 00:36.140
It was an invaluable 
experience for me as well.

00:37.370 --> 00:42.340
I feel as though I have relied on you
far more than my own brother.

00:42.860 --> 00:45.750
I am truly unworthy of such words.

00:46.340 --> 00:47.560
Harij.

00:47.560 --> 00:52.660
Will you please listen to my request, 
not as an order from a princess,

00:52.660 --> 00:55.530
but as a selfish one from Laura, 
who looks to you as a brother?

00:55.530 --> 00:56.590
Selfish?

00:58.420 --> 01:01.870
I would like for you to get 
a love potion for me.

01:05.540 --> 01:06.660
Why?

01:08.630 --> 01:12.000
I'm certain you are already aware 
of the reasons, are you not?

01:16.580 --> 01:18.160
Still...

01:18.160 --> 01:21.490
A love potion is something 
that distorts one's mind.

01:21.490 --> 01:23.180
Altering the paths of others is—

01:23.180 --> 01:24.680
Please, Harij.

01:25.270 --> 01:27.050
It's my once in a lifetime favor.

01:28.770 --> 01:33.690
I have less than a year left now.

01:48.050 --> 01:53.090
<b>Hello, I Am a Witch</b>

01:48.050 --> 01:53.090
<b>and My Crush Wants Me to Make a Love Potion</b>

03:06.960 --> 03:12.420
Episode 3:
The Black Tea
Scented Witch's Song

03:17.090 --> 03:19.300
<i>It seems I was right to bring these.</i>

03:21.800 --> 03:24.510
Lady Witch, do you live here alone?

03:26.460 --> 03:27.480
Yes.

03:27.480 --> 03:29.420
Is that not dangerous?

03:31.930 --> 03:34.710
I do not have many clients.

03:34.710 --> 03:36.500
And if a suspicious person were to come,

03:36.500 --> 03:39.200
I quickly go hide in the basement.

03:39.200 --> 03:42.210
You make it sound like you've already 
experienced some close calls.

03:42.210 --> 03:44.650
It's really not a big deal.

03:45.000 --> 03:47.610
Is that how you've lived your whole life?

03:48.060 --> 03:49.580
Yes, always.

03:52.250 --> 03:55.240
<i>To think a young lady would 
be living all by herself</i>

03:55.240 --> 03:57.710
<i>in a place like this without 
relying on anyone.</i>

03:59.700 --> 04:04.890
<i>No, what can I possibly say as someone 
with no responsibility or involvement?</i>

04:21.570 --> 04:22.730
Pardon me.

04:25.780 --> 04:28.760
Um, this isn't exactly a 
gathering spot, you know?

04:28.760 --> 04:29.500
Don't mind me.

04:32.200 --> 04:33.930
<i>I don't understand...</i>

04:34.330 --> 04:35.170
<i>But!</i>

04:36.370 --> 04:38.550
<i>I'll forgive him because 
he brought me this basket!</i>

04:38.550 --> 04:40.590
<i>Something smells good!</i>

04:40.590 --> 04:42.460
What is this?

04:42.460 --> 04:44.040
It's a tarte tatin.

04:48.150 --> 04:50.480
A tarte tatin...

04:50.830 --> 04:52.300
I'll go ahead and cut it up.

04:52.300 --> 04:53.200
Please.

04:54.950 --> 04:56.240
<i>I'm so relieved.</i>

04:56.820 --> 05:00.730
<i>I thought things would be awkward between 
us after what happened yesterday.</i>

05:01.130 --> 05:05.110
<i>But I feel like I'm able to talk
to him a little more naturally now.</i>

05:08.010 --> 05:10.610
<i>Though I've forgotten what I showed him.</i>

05:10.610 --> 05:12.160
<i>I've absolutely forgotten!</i>

05:12.160 --> 05:13.820
Oh, could I have extra tea leaves?

05:14.230 --> 05:15.410
Tea leaves?

05:19.840 --> 05:21.750
Oh, I see.

05:22.500 --> 05:25.340
<i>It never occurred to me to serve tea.</i>

05:25.340 --> 05:27.580
<i>I wonder if he intends on staying long.</i>

05:31.180 --> 05:33.480
<i>He did bring me a treat, too.</i>

05:39.480 --> 05:40.560
<i>I'm pretty sure</i>

05:40.560 --> 05:44.480
<i>there's some tea I received from
 a client somewhere around here.</i>

05:50.410 --> 05:51.610
Here it is.

05:54.480 --> 05:55.570
It's moldy.

05:56.550 --> 05:57.580
Hold it!

05:57.580 --> 06:00.140
You weren't about to steep 
something like that, were you?!

06:03.080 --> 06:05.260
I'll bring some tea leaves tomorrow.

06:05.260 --> 06:06.490
Uh-huh.

06:06.790 --> 06:08.890
What?! You're coming tomorrow, too?!

06:08.890 --> 06:10.010
Yeah.

06:10.010 --> 06:11.520
Do you have a preference?

06:11.520 --> 06:13.000
Not in particular.

06:13.000 --> 06:16.090
<i>Not that I mind, but my 
heart can't handle it!</i>

06:16.090 --> 06:17.230
What is it?

06:18.320 --> 06:21.010
Oh, no. It's just that you visit so often.

06:21.010 --> 06:23.250
Does it not affect your schedule?

06:23.250 --> 06:24.460
It's not a problem.

06:24.460 --> 06:27.280
My colleagues actually keep
 nagging me to take time off.

06:28.320 --> 06:29.810
Time off?

06:29.810 --> 06:34.670
But given the duties of a royal guard, 
it's difficult to fully take the day off.

06:34.670 --> 06:36.290
A day off?

06:36.990 --> 06:41.960
Lady Witch, could it be that you have no 
concept of weekdays or holidays?

06:42.500 --> 06:44.430
Er, you could say that...

06:46.450 --> 06:51.020
Instead of taking the entire day 
off, I extend my midday breaks.

06:55.550 --> 06:58.850
<i>Has he been going out of his way 
to come see me during his breaks?</i>

06:58.850 --> 07:00.360
<i>To bring me treats?</i>

07:00.770 --> 07:03.700
Besides, it's relaxing here.

07:09.650 --> 07:11.960
Have you grown fond of this forest?

07:12.870 --> 07:14.870
Yeah, I love it.

07:18.400 --> 07:19.810
I do, as well.

07:28.210 --> 07:30.290
<i>I love it, too.</i>

07:31.340 --> 07:35.180
<i>Turns out I love the same 
things as the person I love.</i>

07:41.600 --> 07:43.770
Unfortunately, I didn't 
have any black tea.

07:43.770 --> 07:45.270
Would hot water be all right?

07:45.270 --> 07:46.480
I don't mind.

07:46.480 --> 07:48.070
Thank you for the treat.

07:55.240 --> 07:57.390
<i>Just as I thought,
he has impeccable manners.</i>

08:03.630 --> 08:07.720
<i>The refreshing apple scent 
and the bittersweet caramel...</i>

08:07.720 --> 08:08.960
<i>It's pure joy.</i>

08:22.810 --> 08:24.780
I'll take your plate.

08:24.780 --> 08:25.860
I appreciate it.

08:33.950 --> 08:37.400
<i>At this rate, I might 
run out of tableware.</i>

08:37.890 --> 08:39.110
Oh.

08:40.560 --> 08:45.540
<i>There ought to be some that 
Grandma used to use up there.</i>

08:52.600 --> 08:54.040
Which one do you want?

08:54.040 --> 08:56.460
Dear client, please do 
not concern yourself.

08:56.710 --> 08:58.350
Which one do you want?

08:58.350 --> 09:00.260
<i>I suppose asking him is faster.</i>

09:00.260 --> 09:03.850
Then would you mind opening 
the left door please?

09:03.850 --> 09:04.840
All right.

09:09.980 --> 09:11.250
Move out of the way.

09:11.250 --> 09:14.390
You may get injured if things fall out.

09:23.710 --> 09:25.300
Very impressive.

09:25.300 --> 09:28.340
You should learn to tidy 
up a little bit more.

09:28.580 --> 09:30.640
And, which one do you need?

09:30.640 --> 09:32.330
The one at the back of the cupboard.

09:32.330 --> 09:33.700
There's still some back there?

09:33.700 --> 09:35.620
Oh, don't touch that small bottle.

09:35.620 --> 09:37.870
And be careful of that paper bag as well.

09:37.870 --> 09:39.890
It's the one diagonal to the left and—

09:38.570 --> 09:39.890
I'm going to pick you up.

09:45.020 --> 09:46.090
Get it.

09:46.090 --> 09:47.490
Y-Yesh.

09:50.220 --> 09:51.900
I got it.

09:56.640 --> 09:58.540
She's still too thin.

09:58.540 --> 10:01.160
<i>Wh-What a way to check my weight.</i>

10:01.160 --> 10:04.290
<i>He acknowledges me as a human 
being, but not as a woman?!</i>

10:05.990 --> 10:07.090
I found it.

10:07.090 --> 10:07.970
It's this.

10:07.970 --> 10:09.560
It's a beautiful color.

10:09.560 --> 10:11.850
A highly skilled craftsman 
must have made it.

10:11.850 --> 10:13.160
Beautiful, isn't it?

10:13.450 --> 10:15.620
I was thinking of using this as your—

10:18.090 --> 10:19.520
<i>I can't believe myself.</i>

10:19.890 --> 10:23.490
<i>To think I've begun to 
dream of the next time</i>

10:23.490 --> 10:26.140
<i>Lord Harij would bring me sweets again.</i>

10:27.570 --> 10:28.680
What's the matter?

10:28.680 --> 10:30.510
No, um...

10:30.510 --> 10:34.280
I've been having more clients lately, so 
I thought to set more tableware aside.

10:34.570 --> 10:37.750
<i>Ugh, this is why I hate love.</i>

10:37.750 --> 10:39.480
<i>It turns me into a fool.</i>

10:49.370 --> 10:50.300
Huh?

10:57.670 --> 10:59.200
What are you doing?!

10:59.200 --> 11:00.460
I can't see your face.

11:00.460 --> 11:02.960
Oh, no, no, no! 
I'm trying <i>not</i> to show it!

11:02.960 --> 11:05.500
You're selling things to clients
 without showing your face?

11:05.500 --> 11:06.800
That's right.

11:06.800 --> 11:09.410
A witch's secret remedy is made 
of mysteries and secrets!

11:09.410 --> 11:12.420
And, well, yes, it's to 
protect myself as well—

11:12.420 --> 11:13.660
You've no need to right now.

11:13.660 --> 11:16.130
<i>But I do! More than ever!</i>

11:16.130 --> 11:18.370
<i>I need it the most when I'm with you!</i>

11:18.770 --> 11:21.470
Why do I concern you so much?

11:21.470 --> 11:22.940
What do you mean why?

11:22.940 --> 11:26.680
Does everyone know of the secret 
that witches cannot tell a lie?

11:27.670 --> 11:32.660
Then I'm the only person you can 
talk to face-to-face, am I not?

11:33.000 --> 11:35.200
Even when it shows on your face,

11:35.200 --> 11:37.500
aren't I the only one you
can be honest with and say that

11:37.500 --> 11:39.040
you don't want to talk about it?

11:39.520 --> 11:41.750
Then there's no need for it right now.

11:43.460 --> 11:48.480
<i>Are you trying to become the one 
person who can keep me company?</i>

11:48.940 --> 11:52.260
<i>Is that why you came here 
again today, without reason?</i>

11:55.600 --> 11:59.730
<i>I can't possibly turn down 
a reason as kind as that.</i>

12:01.580 --> 12:03.360
Very well.

12:06.270 --> 12:11.450
It's been a while since I've spoken 
to anyone face-to-face like this,

12:11.450 --> 12:13.960
so please forgive me if I do
anything to offend you.

12:16.520 --> 12:19.410
Just as I thought. 
You do have a lovely face.

12:20.880 --> 12:22.320
No, I take it back!

12:22.320 --> 12:23.400
I-I'm sorry!

12:23.400 --> 12:27.350
I keep forgetting my nieces hate
 it when I talk like that these days.

12:27.350 --> 12:28.340
I won't say it anymore.

12:28.340 --> 12:29.590
No, I shall never take it off again.

12:29.590 --> 12:32.840
Lady Witch! I'm sorry! Lady Witch!

12:33.280 --> 12:34.720
<i>Damn you!</i>

12:34.980 --> 12:37.990
<b>Hello, I Am a Witch and
My Crush Wants Me to
Make a Love Potion</b>

12:37.990 --> 12:40.990
<b>and My Crush Wants Me to Make a Love Potion</b>

12:37.990 --> 12:40.990
<b>Hello, I am a Witch</b>

12:44.000 --> 12:48.720
One scoop, two scoops

12:49.240 --> 12:54.740
of orange and lemon.

12:54.740 --> 12:59.300
The masala can be found

13:00.000 --> 13:05.620
near the southern part of the garden,

13:06.090 --> 13:11.350
on the upper half of

13:11.350 --> 13:15.340
the second rocky knob.

13:15.930 --> 13:20.720
Add half the amount of cinnamon.

13:21.350 --> 13:26.890
Stir it round and round in the mortar.

13:27.450 --> 13:29.920
How much of it?

13:29.920 --> 13:32.620
This much of it.

13:32.620 --> 13:37.570
Let's see. Enough to 
put a whale to sleep.

13:38.120 --> 13:47.880
With plenty of sweet sugar as well.

13:48.700 --> 13:50.120
I've made us tea.

13:52.560 --> 13:57.010
I honestly wasn't expecting you to 
actually bring the tea the very next day.

13:57.280 --> 13:58.970
I promised you, didn't I?

13:58.970 --> 14:00.290
I'll be back tomorrow, as well.

14:00.290 --> 14:01.490
Right...

14:01.490 --> 14:02.620
Is that a problem?

14:02.620 --> 14:04.220
I've given up already.

14:04.220 --> 14:06.710
I'm relieved to see you've 
given up on the hood as well.

14:06.710 --> 14:09.210
I am still anxious and such, but...

14:09.210 --> 14:10.440
And such?

14:10.900 --> 14:12.650
It's a witch's secret.

14:15.380 --> 14:17.390
<i>It's embarrassing, okay?</i>

14:25.530 --> 14:28.900
It has a wondrous aroma. It's my first 
time drinking it, but it's not bad.

14:28.900 --> 14:30.200
Your first time?

14:30.200 --> 14:31.880
What does it usually taste like?

14:31.880 --> 14:34.250
I normally enjoy it using 
just the tea leaves.

14:34.250 --> 14:36.790
Does that mean you don't add spices?

14:36.790 --> 14:39.470
Yeah. Seeing it brewed in 
a pot is a first as well.

14:41.040 --> 14:43.750
This black tea seems like 
it would go well with milk.

14:43.750 --> 14:44.940
I'll bring some next time.

14:45.250 --> 14:47.060
Milk, huh...

14:48.900 --> 14:54.040
Glow

14:49.210 --> 14:50.780
<i>So fluffy!</i>

14:50.780 --> 14:53.730
<i>The apple sweetness is packed 
right into the jam as well.</i>

14:54.040 --> 14:56.240
You truly eat it like it's delicious.

14:56.240 --> 14:59.960
After all, there are no 
restrictions to a witch's meal.

14:59.960 --> 15:03.680
If that's the case, shouldn't you properly
 nourish yourself on a regular basis?

15:04.990 --> 15:07.840
Does your garden mostly 
have medicinal herbs?

15:11.010 --> 15:13.150
What kind of things do you make?

15:14.470 --> 15:18.010
I assume you aren't brewing something 
suspicious all the time, are you?

15:18.010 --> 15:22.360
<i>I'll have you know you're the one seeking 
that suspicious potion, Lord Harij.</i>

15:22.970 --> 15:26.440
I brew things like remedies to ward off
 sleepiness, remedy patches for bruises,

15:26.440 --> 15:29.560
and remedies to use when a foreign 
object gets into the eye.

15:29.760 --> 15:32.520
<i>I also have a remedy to make 
one popular with girls,</i>

15:32.520 --> 15:34.540
<i>but there's no need to mention that one.</i>

15:34.540 --> 15:37.640
You make rather ordinary 
things as well, don't you?

15:37.640 --> 15:40.140
There are some that are used 
by the Order of Knights.

15:40.140 --> 15:42.000
Oh, really?

15:42.270 --> 15:44.590
<i>I would be happy if my remedies</i>

15:44.590 --> 15:48.080
<i>were healing Lord Harij's wounds 
in some roundabout way.</i>

15:49.340 --> 15:53.000
I believe you've mentioned 
growing lettuce as well.

15:54.290 --> 15:56.470
<i>Oh, he remembered.</i>

15:56.470 --> 15:58.430
Is lettuce used as a 
medicinal herb as well?

15:58.430 --> 16:00.820
I use it to bring down fevers sometimes,

16:00.820 --> 16:03.350
but it's rare to be used in 
a witch's secret remedy.

16:03.350 --> 16:04.430
Then why?

16:04.430 --> 16:06.790
Because my grandmother 
ordered me to grow some.

16:06.790 --> 16:09.680
My grandmother was a witch, 
as well as my mentor.

16:10.290 --> 16:13.910
That garden has rare 
medicinal herbs planted there,

16:13.910 --> 16:18.630
so I've been told since she was alive
 to keep it maintained no matter what.

16:19.000 --> 16:21.320
She was a rather naggy grandmother.

16:25.100 --> 16:26.330
I see.

16:26.330 --> 16:28.000
Do you have any other family?

16:28.000 --> 16:32.170
Apparently, my mother passed before 
I was old enough to remember anything,

16:32.170 --> 16:34.050
so I don't have any 
memories of her at all.

16:34.780 --> 16:36.000
I see.

16:36.000 --> 16:39.050
As for my father, I don't 
know if he even existed.

16:39.050 --> 16:40.840
Certainly he existed.

16:40.840 --> 16:43.720
It's not as if you sprouted
from the garden, Lady Witch.

16:46.240 --> 16:47.930
Your dear grandmother

16:47.930 --> 16:51.190
must have been worried about what would 
happen to you after she passed.

16:51.190 --> 16:52.410
What?

16:52.410 --> 16:55.480
She was concerned about
you being left all alone.

16:55.480 --> 17:00.010
Since you're too careless with your 
eating habits it's unbearable to watch.

17:00.010 --> 17:02.590
Was it actually that bad?

17:02.590 --> 17:04.910
I was properly eating lettuce, you know.

17:04.910 --> 17:08.460
I'm uncertain whether eating lettuce 
is considered a proper meal.

17:08.920 --> 17:12.390
But that lettuce must've been an 
arrangement your grandmother thought of.

17:14.110 --> 17:18.340
I assume she had a good
understanding of your habits.

17:18.340 --> 17:20.290
And what does that mean?

17:20.290 --> 17:22.770
If you were told to maintain 
the medicinal herbs,

17:22.770 --> 17:24.970
you'd also tend to 
the lettuce, wouldn't you?

17:25.350 --> 17:29.020
And you'd consider it a waste if it 
wasn't eaten once you've harvested it.

17:34.940 --> 17:38.660
<i>It's true that I had thought 
about cooking at one point...</i>

17:44.090 --> 17:48.880
<i>After Grandma passed away, I realized
 that I need to be able to live on my own.</i>

17:49.520 --> 17:53.770
<i>But I didn't find the meals 
I cooked to be appetizing,</i>

17:53.770 --> 17:57.150
<i>and eating became such a hassle that 
I even started developing a remedy</i>

17:57.150 --> 17:59.110
<i>that would get rid of hunger.</i>

17:59.700 --> 18:03.590
<i>Even so, I kept my promise with Grandma,</i>

18:03.590 --> 18:06.040
<i>and continued to carefully tend 
to the medicinal garden.</i>

18:06.620 --> 18:09.090
<i>There was always leftover 
lettuce, so I snacked on it.</i>

18:09.410 --> 18:12.070
<i>There was no reason behind it.</i>

18:12.730 --> 18:17.560
<i>But I guess that she deeply cherished 
me far more than I had realized.</i>

18:25.710 --> 18:29.990
<i>The reason why he noticed my grandma's 
love is because Lord Harij</i>

18:29.990 --> 18:32.950
<i>is the kind of person 
who thinks that way.</i>

18:34.250 --> 18:36.250
Thank you very much.

18:36.250 --> 18:38.310
You should thank your grandmother.

18:45.410 --> 18:47.270
I guess I really am in love.

18:48.160 --> 18:51.230
I bet you are. This bread is delicious.

18:51.230 --> 18:52.060
What?

18:59.610 --> 19:00.700
Here.

19:11.710 --> 19:13.040
Do you want more?

19:14.290 --> 19:15.930
After I eat this one.

19:16.350 --> 19:17.420
All right.

19:21.930 --> 19:24.670
How much of it?

19:24.670 --> 19:27.340
This much of it.

19:28.560 --> 19:30.780
It really sticks with you.

19:30.780 --> 19:33.020
Enough to put what to sleep again?

19:33.830 --> 19:35.220
A whale.

19:35.460 --> 19:39.820
Although, I don't exactly know how 
much would put a whale to sleep.

19:40.270 --> 19:41.210
Me, neither.

19:41.210 --> 19:46.560
From what to put in and how much, how 
thoroughly to grind, and how long to boil.

19:46.560 --> 19:50.060
The rhythm of the song captures the 
entire brewing process for the tea.

19:50.060 --> 19:51.530
It's a nice song.

19:51.530 --> 19:52.400
Yes.

19:52.400 --> 19:57.340
By the time I finish singing, it tastes
 exactly like my grandmother's tea.

19:57.340 --> 19:58.950
Did you also learn that song from her?

19:58.950 --> 20:00.090
Perish the thought.

20:00.090 --> 20:02.720
My grandmother was not
the sort of person to sing.

20:02.720 --> 20:05.430
Then who taught you that song?

20:05.680 --> 20:06.660
Hm?

20:11.340 --> 20:13.110
You grew up listening to it, did you not?

20:13.890 --> 20:15.550
I did.

20:15.550 --> 20:20.770
I loved listening to the sound of 
the pot boil along with this song.

20:24.940 --> 20:30.000
So there was someone right next to you
who sang it over and over again.

20:30.000 --> 20:32.550
So much that you could 
remember it perfectly.

20:34.170 --> 20:35.670
That's...

20:35.670 --> 20:37.320
Someone who isn't your grandmother.

20:37.320 --> 20:39.910
And certainly not the father 
that you do not even know.

20:40.640 --> 20:42.810
Then the only one who remains is...

20:49.680 --> 20:52.380
How much of it?

20:52.380 --> 20:54.930
This much of it.

20:54.930 --> 20:59.870
Let's see. Enough to 
put a whale to sleep.

21:03.370 --> 21:05.110
Mother...?

21:05.880 --> 21:10.110
You said you don't have any memories, 
but you certainly did remember her.

21:16.540 --> 21:20.730
That scowl was meant for 
deception, wasn't it?

21:22.490 --> 21:24.590
<i>Witches cannot tell a lie.</i>

21:25.130 --> 21:28.070
<i>I was so afraid of someone finding out,</i>

21:28.070 --> 21:31.080
<i>that I've protected myself 
by hiding my expression.</i>

21:31.080 --> 21:32.570
<i>By hiding the truth.</i>

21:33.980 --> 21:36.800
<i>But that's right...</i>

21:37.270 --> 21:40.940
<i>It's no longer possible to 
completely fool this man.</i>

21:41.260 --> 21:47.890
<i>Since he's decided to keep me company, 
fully knowing the witch's secret.</i>

22:00.330 --> 22:03.500
<i>Right now, I feel so happy.</i>

22:10.890 --> 22:17.440
